{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0023_1000_029umi", "source_sha256": "eb6b00b7809344433ba3f7a092e598e117e8ab11d6c384fc1f67e96b9ea9cc5f", "ja": "来た来た来たーっ、海だーっ♪\nサーフィンするんだよね？　それじゃ、さっそくっ！", "zh": "来了来了来了──！是海耶──♪\n要冲浪对不对？那就马上开始吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0023_1001_p", "source_sha256": "cca0141350db5752ceeb3c7abdcb2411c58ac94062ab305e55d8641f251489a5", "ja": "や、やっと追い着いた……って、こら、海美！\n海に着いてすぐ、飛び込もうとするんじゃない！", "zh": "终、终于追上了……我说海美！\n别一抵达海边，就马上想跳进去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0023_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "6065e5320ad2ed7cde09e7780301324cf31f4a461d5d0fbf8f5031956b3659fe", "ja": "え？　あ、あはははっ♪\nごめん、{$P$}。準備運動だよね！", "zh": "咦？啊、啊哈哈哈哈♪\n抱歉，{$P$}。应该先热身对不对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0023_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "1f68dfd04fd9da03727d60114d39c56b8389d4a394b65b4b08ba0e546bf5055c", "ja": "もちろん、忘れてないよ！\nいっちにー、さんしー。ごーろく、しち、はち！", "zh": "我当然没有忘记喔！\n1234、5678！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0023_1004_p", "source_sha256": "aaa2617093b583622edcb602e49f9e638a8e3bf5eab773d9ca8581dccdbdcd80", "ja": "いや、準備運動だけじゃなくて……。\n着いたばかりなんだ、少し休憩してからにしよう。", "zh": "不，不只是热身……\n我们才刚到，先稍微休息一下再开始吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0023_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "15679aade6ad5099171f66c9619fb7a99f6974e4dbafc2d7d1cfb7e07b9eb0a9", "ja": "あっ、なら海の中で休憩するといいかもっ！\n泳げば疲れもとれるし♪", "zh": "啊，那在海中休息好像不错喔！\n毕竟游泳可以消除疲劳嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0023_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2adbaa0157c675e2be1f4e980ff9957bb70df8adb4d77fb54e4d3ea55c8b70e8", "ja": "泳げば疲れが取れるって、魚じゃないんだから……\n本当に元気だな、海美は。疲れてないのか？", "zh": "什么游泳可以消除疲劳，又不是鱼……\n海美真的很有活力呢。你不累吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0023_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "05adc4a18f047706fcecf18dc6cdb674d7eb62f17f154585340a473031e7610e", "ja": "だって、それが私の取り柄だし！　体を動かすと、\nなんかエンジン温まってきたって感じするって言うか！", "zh": "因为这是我的优点啊！只要活动身体，\n就有股引擎热起来的感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0023_1008_p", "source_sha256": "ff409aa580d117752a59b386ecbc131ee54a021b7d8202c04c6bfb543db37a29", "ja": "まさに、水を得た魚……いや、海を得た海美だな。\nわかった。ひと息ついたらすぐ行こう！", "zh": "简直是如鱼得水……不，如海美得海吧。\n我知道了，喘口气后就马上过去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0023_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "fec48f7d7874370da210d40820b1400b533d83e5a337fc11d49c9027dadb39cb", "ja": "うんっ！　{$P$}、ありがとー！\nサーフィンするの、すっごく楽しみだよ☆", "zh": "嗯！{$P$}，谢谢你──！\n我超级期待去冲浪的☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
